keep it keep it rockin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.445" end="00:33.345">Party ain ’t stoppin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.345" end="00:34.845">No fear good times are here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.815" end="00:36.835">When I come round the good times appear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.835" end="00:38.335">Good times are near</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.755" end="00:39.495">I like to live life like where they all gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.495" end="00:41.450">The good times are here where</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.450" end="00:42.950">Late nights shoppin ’on the Thursday</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.595" end="00:44.734">And I pull out more than a birthday</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.734" end="00:46.234">I ’m always flying abroad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.130" end="00:48.582">When I wake up tomorrow I ’m gonna be on the 1st plane</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.582" end="00:54.610">9to 5when it ’s over I can come alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.610" end="00:58.430">I ’m in the mood to live a higher life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.430" end="01:01.310">Now when the DJ drops a song of mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.310" end="01:03.570">I ’ll be satisfied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.570" end="01:06.310">I ’m gonna leave the day behind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.310" end="01:07.810">Don ’t you worry cause</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.800" end="01:10.300">I ’m gonna have a real good time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.300" end="01:11.800">We ’re gonna have a real good time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.660" end="01:14.720">I ’m gonna leave the world outside spend my money</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.720" end="01:17.760">Oh it ’s gonna be a real good night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.760" end="01:19.260">We ’re gonna have a real good night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.990" end="01:22.578">Go late night shoppin ’high street boppin ’</p><p t